# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json
# ...except the frontend, which Vercel builds from source. Without a committed
# lockfile `npm install` re-resolves every floating range on each deploy, so the
# built version drifts from what was reviewed here.
!frontend/package-lock.json

